Well, I don't know what obvious hormonal issues are, whether it has to do with

00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:27,540
frequent or infrequent or abnormal periods, abnormal bleeding at periods, or you're talking about

00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:36,420
emotional hormonal issues. All those can be signs of hormonal dysfunction. As a per, I don't know

00:00:36,420 --> 00:00:40,580
how old your daughter is, whether they're in their teens and they're just starting to get their

00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:45,780
period and they're just starting to deal with these different hormonal influxes. If that's the case

00:00:46,660 --> 00:00:52,820
diet plays a big role in these hormonal influxes because as we're, if you're eating a typical

00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:59,780
American diet, you're exposed to so many bad estrogens and estrogen disrupting

00:00:59,780 --> 00:01:07,620
poisons and toxins in a typical American diet that it throws off your hormone balance.

