00:01:14,580 --> 00:01:19,300
pituitary is just starting to kick out the different hormones and stimulates estrogen and

00:01:19,300 --> 00:01:25,460
progesterone production and balance. Getting that balance is really important. Certainly you

00:01:25,460 --> 00:01:32,180
could do a Dutch test, which is a dried urine hormone test to see where that person is at

00:01:33,380 --> 00:01:40,180
and see where the imbalance is to know how to deal with it. Many times a person, a young lady who

00:01:40,180 --> 00:01:49,700
