00:02:03,620 --> 00:02:09,620
hormones through a Dutch test. There's different nutrients that can help balance hormones as well.

00:02:10,580 --> 00:02:15,780
So if you're talking about hormonal issues that are more emotionally based and they're having

00:02:16,180 --> 00:02:22,260
